  Mode: 58
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Waystation
  Description: 'Tiger Moths only. Weave each cluster of rings, then climb down the Drop Tower to the
    next: short hops through floor plates, each ring just past its plate. Tap too short and
    you land on the plate; hold too long and the pipe ahead meets you before the Drop is
    back. Plates are mostly plain at low intensity, more of them danger as it climbs. The
    last gap is one long drop, and it leaves a wormhole for whoever follows.'
